  "prefLabel": "Site 102.05 Adjudicative proceeding",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Site 102.05 “Adjudicative proceeding” means “adjudicative proceeding” as defined in RSA 541-A:1, I, namely, “the procedure to be followed in contested cases, as set forth in RSA 541-A:31 through RSA 541-A:36.”\n\nSource. #9182, eff 6-17-08; ss by #10993, eff 12-16-15",
